    "name": "Idol Party",
    "steam_appid": 2955300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/4a6084d02dd9bddc96354ff06849f4fb.avif?t=1754374140\" data-has-big width=800 height=1066 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To show our gratitude for the support from our players, we will be offering exclusive PC rewards for all Super Idols, including the full set of Rabbit\u00b7Alice and Rabbit\u00b7Lilith outfits, thrones, and a variety of rare items! Join our Discord to claim more exclusive PC rewards and get the latest event updates firsthand! <br> <br><strong>CDK:</strong> <br><strong>SS9M4FHYZU</strong> <br><strong>COUNTDOWN7DAYS <br>LAUNCHDAY <br>RABBITDISLILITHCORD</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idol development system, popular social music game! (*\u2579\u25bd\u2579*) Welcome everyone to Nico's singing and dancing world~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Idol Party&quot; is a music game with a lively style using the concept of idols!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous costumes, personalized mounts, massive music songs, everything you want is here. Scroll down quickly and let Nico introduce it to you, idols\u10da(\u2579\u25e1\u2579\u10da)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203bDancing &amp; Rhythmic Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!!Attention: non-combatants please evacuate quickly, this is a gathering of dancing masters~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 modes in Charming Dance: Rhythm, Classic, Tempo, Tradition. There is also a massive music songs of different genres, bringing a super realistic stage singing experience~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is another secret, Nico will tell you quietly (\u3065\uffe33\uffe3): When the game is over, you can click &quot;Save&quot; to store this game recording in the video gallery, and you can watch it anytime you want~ It can also become a hot video ~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/90e324d0d40a0752398fc4b0c4f4fadc.poster.avif?t=1754374140\" width=320 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/90e324d0d40a0752398fc4b0c4f4fadc.webm?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/90e324d0d40a0752398fc4b0c4f4fadc.mp4?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203bKaraoke King Enjoy the Sound of Nature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How can it only have dancing? (\u0e51\u2032\u1d17\u2035\u0e51)~~ Let everyone know about your wonderful singing voice! Select the karaoke mode in the game, choose your favorite song and sing as loudly as you want~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who said that a concert requires many steps and requirements? In the game, \u10da(\u2579\u25e1\u2579\u10da) you can start your own concert on your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a unique sync mode, which can create new bonds with queens/kings of Karaoke!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/850b73a86c465139a0af8cf689e51e5f.poster.avif?t=1754374140\" width=320 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/850b73a86c465139a0af8cf689e51e5f.webm?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/850b73a86c465139a0af8cf689e51e5f.mp4?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Shining Star Ever-changing Shapes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to become a fashionista in the Idol Party world ??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant fashions, campus energetic girls' clothing, trendy men's casual clothing, beautiful ancient style clothing, and limited sets are available for idols to unlock. \u2570(*\u00b0\u25bd\u00b0*)\u256fWhat are the idols still hesitating about~<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/6ff2ae5a594f8679cec00ee05b5f7ec2.poster.avif?t=1754374140\" width=320 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/6ff2ae5a594f8679cec00ee05b5f7ec2.webm?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/6ff2ae5a594f8679cec00ee05b5f7ec2.mp4?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b brand New Community More Fun to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(,,\uff65\u2200\uff65)\uff89\u309bHi~~~Nico also brought new information! ! ! The main community has been revised~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main community is not only expanding, but also adding many interactive facilities, such as carousels, swing planes, pedal pianos, etc.~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si~ What sound is that?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/4a6084d02dd9bddc96354ff06849f4fb.avif?t=1754374140\" data-has-big width=800 height=1066 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To show our gratitude for the support from our players, we will be offering exclusive PC rewards for all Super Idols, including the full set of Rabbit\u00b7Alice and Rabbit\u00b7Lilith outfits, thrones, and a variety of rare items! Join our Discord to claim more exclusive PC rewards and get the latest event updates firsthand! <br> <br><strong>CDK:</strong> <br><strong>SS9M4FHYZU</strong> <br><strong>COUNTDOWN7DAYS <br>LAUNCHDAY <br>RABBITDISLILITHCORD</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idol development system, popular social music game! (*\u2579\u25bd\u2579*) Welcome everyone to Nico's singing and dancing world~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Idol Party&quot; is a music game with a lively style using the concept of idols!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous costumes, personalized mounts, massive music songs, everything you want is here. Scroll down quickly and let Nico introduce it to you, idols\u10da(\u2579\u25e1\u2579\u10da)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203bDancing &amp; Rhythmic Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!!Attention: non-combatants please evacuate quickly, this is a gathering of dancing masters~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 modes in Charming Dance: Rhythm, Classic, Tempo, Tradition. There is also a massive music songs of different genres, bringing a super realistic stage singing experience~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is another secret, Nico will tell you quietly (\u3065\uffe33\uffe3): When the game is over, you can click &quot;Save&quot; to store this game recording in the video gallery, and you can watch it anytime you want~ It can also become a hot video ~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/90e324d0d40a0752398fc4b0c4f4fadc.poster.avif?t=1754374140\" width=320 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/90e324d0d40a0752398fc4b0c4f4fadc.webm?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/90e324d0d40a0752398fc4b0c4f4fadc.mp4?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203bKaraoke King Enjoy the Sound of Nature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How can it only have dancing? (\u0e51\u2032\u1d17\u2035\u0e51)~~ Let everyone know about your wonderful singing voice! Select the karaoke mode in the game, choose your favorite song and sing as loudly as you want~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who said that a concert requires many steps and requirements? In the game, \u10da(\u2579\u25e1\u2579\u10da) you can start your own concert on your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a unique sync mode, which can create new bonds with queens/kings of Karaoke!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/850b73a86c465139a0af8cf689e51e5f.poster.avif?t=1754374140\" width=320 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/850b73a86c465139a0af8cf689e51e5f.webm?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/850b73a86c465139a0af8cf689e51e5f.mp4?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Shining Star Ever-changing Shapes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to become a fashionista in the Idol Party world ??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant fashions, campus energetic girls' clothing, trendy men's casual clothing, beautiful ancient style clothing, and limited sets are available for idols to unlock. \u2570(*\u00b0\u25bd\u00b0*)\u256fWhat are the idols still hesitating about~<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/6ff2ae5a594f8679cec00ee05b5f7ec2.poster.avif?t=1754374140\" width=320 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/6ff2ae5a594f8679cec00ee05b5f7ec2.webm?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955300/extras/6ff2ae5a594f8679cec00ee05b5f7ec2.mp4?t=1754374140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b brand New Community More Fun to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(,,\uff65\u2200\uff65)\uff89\u309bHi~~~Nico also brought new information! ! ! The main community has been revised~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main community is not only expanding, but also adding many interactive facilities, such as carousels, swing planes, pedal pianos, etc.~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si~ What sound is that?</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cWOW,you can really dance!\u201d Welcome to IDOL PARTY. Immerse yourself in dance and song to find friends in this social game. Charm your love with moves and melodies, pledge togetherness, marry, and start a family. Tired? Farm or play mini-games for endless fun!",
